title: Fritz Tarnow
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, centrist
card-image: img/portraits/TarnowFritz.jpg
face-image: img/portraits/TarnowFritz.jpg 
view-if: tarnow_advisor = 1
new-page: true

= Fritz Tarnow

Tarnow is [? if chancellor = "Tarnow": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Tarnow": the current President and ?] a leading figure in the ADGB and a proponent of economic democracy.

- @economic_policy_
- @depression
- @union_unity
- @chancellor
- @president

@union_unity
title: Union-party coordination
subtitle: Reduce dissent among the unions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_dissent -= 5; labor_strength += 5

We have reduced tensions with the Labor faction, and increased its strength in the party.

@depression
title: Addressing the economic crisis
subtitle: Formulate a plan to get us out of the economic crisis.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted == 0 and black_thursday_seen == 1 and wtb_support <= 3
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if wtb_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the WTB-Plan. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; wtb_support += 2; center_dissent += 10; labor_strength += 1

The WTB-plan, named for its primary supporters Woytinsky, Tarnow, and Baade, has been adopted as the unions' plan for getting us out of the depression. Woytinsky canvasses in favor of this policy through the SPD and the unions.

@economic_policy_
title: Economic Policy
subtitle: As one of our foremost theorists, Hilferding has sway over our economic policy.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if spd_in_government = 0 : SPD not in government: ?] [? if labor_minister_party != "SPD" or (finance_minister_party != "SPD" and economic_minister_party != "SPD") : We do not have the necessary government ministers. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and spd_in_government == 1 and (economic_minister_party == "SPD")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; economic_democracy_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: economic_policy

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Tarnow can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Tarnow"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Tarnow can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Tarnow"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "SPD" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : [+ article_48_timer +] months before we can next take this action. ?]
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ military_relations_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
